# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:265
translate zh qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_143afabf:

    # "Much to everyone’s surprise, the girl did far better than expected."
    "令所有人惊讶的是，女孩的表现远超预期。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:266
translate zh qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_1960f074:

    # "She deflected each blow parried her way and at one point even managed to kick the Captain back with her foot."
    "她格挡开每一次袭来的攻击，甚至一度用脚将队长踢退。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:270
translate zh qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_62b6d361:

    # "The possibility that she might win hung tentatively in the air..."
    "她可能获胜的悬念悬在空中..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:271
translate zh qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_af36f2ed:

