    "人群鼓掌欢呼，女孩腼腆地笑了。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:293
translate zh qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_05014119:

    # "When she got off the podium, she was welcomed back by the others who all patted her on the back for a fight well fought."
    "她走下台时，同伴们拍着她的背，称赞这场精彩的较量。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:296
translate zh qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_3e8845e2:

    # DUPREY "Alright everyone!"
    DUPREY "好了各位！"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:297
translate zh qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_53cb2fa8:

    # DUPREY "It's a start alright, but we still have a lot of work ahead of us!"
    DUPREY "开局不错，但我们还有很长的路要走！"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:298
translate zh qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_05bea46f:

    # DUPREY "Now, go and take some rest."
    DUPREY "现在，去休息吧。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:300
translate zh qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_df74a53c:

    # DUPREY "By the time the sun hits these training dummies, I expect you lot here again!"
    DUPREY "等阳光照到这些训练假人时，我要看到你们回来！"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:301
translate zh qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_ee4f7f5b:

    # DUPREY "Dismissed!"
    DUPREY "解散！"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:326
translate zh qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_0bd9b2e5:

    # DUPREY "It stands to reason, you maggots."
    DUPREY "道理很简单，你们这群蛆虫。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:327
translate zh qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_c6b5eac0:

    # DUPREY "That to {i}kill{/i} the enemy, you must first strike him."
    DUPREY "要{i}杀死{/i}敌人，必先击中他。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:328
translate zh qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_75af9096:

    # DUPREY "You cannot hesitate with your blade, not even for a second."
    DUPREY "握剑时不可犹豫，一秒都不行。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:329
translate zh qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_56b25b16:

    # DUPREY "The Demorai will spare you no quarter."
    DUPREY "德莫莱人不会手下留情。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:330
translate zh qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_94c5eb63:

    # DUPREY "They know no fear."
    DUPREY "他们不知恐惧为何物。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:331
translate zh qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_87825edf:

    # DUPREY "Hesitation does not exist in the minds of the enemy you will face."
    DUPREY "你们将面对的敌人心中没有犹豫。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:332
translate zh qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_2ae3da65:

    # DUPREY "They will not stop, they will keep coming until {i}you{/i} are dead."
    DUPREY "他们不会停歇，会不断进攻直到{i}你{/i}死亡。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:333
translate zh qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_a1a19941:

    # DUPREY "...So {i}you{/i} will not stop, {i}you{/i} will know no hesitation either."
    DUPREY "...所以{i}你{/i}也不能停歇，{i}你{/i}心中也不可有犹豫。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:334
translate zh qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_9ef65af9:

    # DUPREY "{i}You{/i} will make them kiss the blades you carry and grant them the death they so crave!"
    DUPREY "{i}你{/i}要让他们亲吻你手中的利刃，赐予他们渴求的死亡！"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:335
translate zh qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_931fd1a0:

    # "There was some cheering, whistles and claps from the recruits, but Captain Duprey remained stoically the same."
    "新兵们发出欢呼与口哨声，但杜普雷队长依然面无表情。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:336
translate zh qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_3c541189:

    # DUPREY "When you strike at an enemy, if you're too slow they may dodge or block the strike."
    DUPREY "攻击敌人时若速度太慢，对方可能闪避或格挡。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:337
translate zh qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_935e6dba:

    # DUPREY "Get used to that feeling of metal clashing, you lose your blade out in the field, {i}you're finished.{/i}"
    DUPREY "习惯金属碰撞的感觉——战场上丢了剑，{i}你就完了{/i}。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:338
translate zh qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_bba80207:

    # DUPREY "Now grab someone to spar with."
    DUPREY "现在找人陪练。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:339
translate zh qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_6e24ff53:

    # DUPREY "...BEGIN!"
    DUPREY "...开始！"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:360
translate zh qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_7a71149d:

    # MARKUS "That was... good."
    MARKUS "打得...不错。"

