# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:412
translate zh qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_554aa8aa:

    # "Realizing the splashing was coming from the woman's side, I pondered what to do..."
