translate zh qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_478fa33b:

    # "琪亚拉 grabbed a towel, wrapped it around herself as she marched over towards me, arms folded."
    "琪亚拉抓起毛巾裹身，双臂交叉向我走来。"

