    MC "管它是什么，先去睡一觉。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:868
translate zh qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_6d3b7e65:

    # "In the dead of night, I was restless."
    "夜深人静时，我辗转难眠。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:873
translate zh qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_8c266e01:

    # "Opening my eyes, I sat-upright in my bunk and looked around."
    "睁开双眼，我在铺位上直起身环顾四周。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:875
translate zh qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_ccd5a8ea:

    # "Everyone around me was deep in sleep still, including 马库斯."
    "周围所有人仍在熟睡，包括马库斯。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:876
translate zh qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_03bec688:

    # "I sighed, rubbing my forehead as I climbed out of bed."
    "我叹着气揉揉额头，翻身下床。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:877
translate zh qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_b9564fe7:

    # "{i}Just a short walk around the fort grounds{/i} I told myself..."
    "{i}就在堡垒周围散会儿步{/i} 我告诉自己..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:878
translate zh qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_af74cbd2:

    # "I'll be back before anyone even realizes I'm gone."
    "在任何人发现我离开前就会回来。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:885
translate zh qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_59eaf8b8:

    # "As the cold night air hit my lungs, I thought about heading back inside before I heard Captain Duprey's voice."
    "当寒夜空气涌入肺中时，我正想返回室内，却听见杜普雷队长的声音。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:886
translate zh qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_4acebe14:

    # DUPREY "Thank you all for coming..."
    DUPREY "感谢各位前来..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:887
translate zh qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_14ad4098:

    # MC "(Hm? What's going on?)"
    MC "(嗯？发生什么了？)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:888
translate zh qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_b6dd5166:

    # MC "(It sounds like it's coming from the training yard.)"
    MC "(声音像是从训练场传来的。)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:900
translate zh qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_f159a15b:

    # "Peering around the corner, Captain Duprey stood alongside Borras as two figures joined them."
    "我躲在拐角窥视，杜普雷队长与博拉斯并肩而立，两个身影正向他们走去。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:903
translate zh qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_683fa502:

    # "The first, a beautiful, yet stern and cold looking blonde in a hooded robe."
    "第一位是个金发女子，美丽却面容冷峻，身披兜帽长袍。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:904
translate zh qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_39c09853:

    # "The other, a man of larger stature who I had not seen either."
    "另一位是身材魁梧的男子，我也未曾见过。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:906
translate zh qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_c3816f8a:

    # NYX_BLONDE @ angry "Well, out with it."
    NYX_BLONDE @ angry "有话快说。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:907
translate zh qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_829708c2:

